Here are several alternative patterns in Svelte, aside from using an `{#await}` block.

### 1. Using `async/await` with an IIFE

This is a syntactic improvement on your example. It uses an `async` Immediately Invoked Function Expression (IIFE) inside the reactive block, which many find more readable than `.then()` chains. The core logic remains the same.

