**6. Create the Factory/Registry**

This factory will be injected with all available strategy beans. Its job is to select the correct one.

```java
@Component
public class AccountFinderFactory {

    private final List<AccountFinderStrategy> strategies;

    @Autowired
    public AccountFinderFactory(List<AccountFinderStrategy> strategies) {
        this.strategies = strategies;
    }

    public AccountFinderStrategy getStrategy(UserType userType) {
        return strategies.stream()
                .filter(s -> s.supports(userType))
                .findFirst()
                .orElseThrow(() -> new IllegalArgumentException("No strategy found for user type: " + userType));
    }
}
```

**7. Use the Factory in Your Main Service**

Your main service layer is now clean, simple, and decoupled from the specific repository implementations.

